  <item>
    <title>包装华丽的商品滨崎步，被榨干最后一滴血的偶像</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66c1c58cdb5e6d6bf920df0f</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66c1c58cdb5e6d6bf920df0f</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 19 Aug 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>说起滨崎步大家会想起什么呢？她身上最多的标签大概就是漂亮、时尚、流行教主、美甲，她引流过很多时尚潮流，但如果一个明星她的话题点都是集中在外形上，那她可能是模特，可能是综艺咖，但不可能连续20年都在发歌。</span></p><span></span><p><span>滨崎步的音乐事业这么成功，核心还是因为她的歌词，她的歌词都是她自己写的。从出道单曲到前三四张专辑，孤独、绝望和混乱可以说是滨崎步歌词里经常出现的元素，甚至还推出过被称为绝望三部曲的三张单曲。</span></p><span></span><p><span>滨崎步作为一个被艾回公司包装推出的商品。一方面她要自我物化阉割情绪，一方面，因为她要写歌词，所以她得感受生活，她既没有办法完全听话当个工具，也没办法完全自由任性做个艺术家。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>🕒 本期时间轴&amp;歌曲</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span>第一部分</span></strong></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 滨崎步这么成功核心是因为她的歌词</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="145">02:25</a> A Song for ××</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="224">03:44</a> 滨崎步的家庭&amp;怎么开始做歌手</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="431">07:11</a> appears “HΛL'S Progress"</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="778">12:58</a> 即使在最红的时候，也只是一个商品</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="864">14:24</a> SEASONS</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1120">18:40</a> 滨崎步在亚洲最火的两首歌</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1168">19:28</a> Dearest</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1501">25:01</a> M</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1764">29:24</a> 一个影响时代的偶像，却要被榨干最后一滴血</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1891">31:31</a> No way to say</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2166">36:06</a> 过度工作消耗自己健康的滨崎步</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2311">38:31</a> MOON</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span>第二部分</span></strong></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2484">41:24</a> evolution</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2603">43:23</a> talkin' 2 myself</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2712">45:12</a> theme of a-nation'03</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2878">47:58</a> Mirrorcle World</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3011">50:11</a> Duty</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>✉️ 节目介绍</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>「十一区共犯」是一档JPOP爱好者dulili主持的音乐播客节目。正如第0期节目所说，喜欢JPOP的人在国内是绝对少数，所以希望打造一个轻松交流的同温层。十一区指代日本，「共犯」指代你我的关系。本节目每周一早上<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="480">08:00</a>更新。</span></p><span></span><p><span>📮 如有任何问题或反馈，欢迎评论区留言。</span></p>]]></description>
