    <guid isPermaLink="false">66b8e0c3db5e6d6bf9882560</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 12 Aug 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>Genie High乐队成员来自日本娱乐界的多个背景，其中包括有争议的作曲家新垣隆。主唱是乐队トリコ的中嶋イッキュウ（Ikkyu Nakajima）、吉他手&amp;主唱川谷绘音、鼓手是搞笑艺人小籔千豊、贝斯是搞笑艺人川岛邦裕。（今天标题试试震惊体。）</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>🕒 本期时间轴&amp;歌曲</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="48">00:48</a> Genie High《Genie High Rhapsody》</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="200">03:20</a> 乐队是鼓手，搞笑艺人小䉤千丰在节目中组建的</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="233">03:53</a> Genie High《強がりと弱虫》</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="583">9:43</a> 天才川谷绘音每天除了睡觉就是工作&nbsp;</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="650">10:50</a> ゲスの極み乙女《ロマンスがありあまる》</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="746">12:26</a> indigo la End 《雫に恋して》</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="857">14:17</a> DADARAY 《イキツクシ》</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1003">16:43</a> Genie High《華奢なリップ》</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1317">21:57</a> 键盘手新垣隆的“影子写手”事件</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1538">25:38</a> Genie High《シャミナミ》</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1804">30:04</a> Genie High《Genie High Wash》</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1841">30:41</a> Genie High《まるで幸せ》</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>✉️ 节目介绍</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>「十一区共犯」是一档JPOP爱好者dulili主持的音乐播客节目。正如第0期节目所说，喜欢JPOP的人在国内是绝对少数，所以希望打造一个轻松交流的同温层。十一区指代日本，「共犯」指代你我的关系。本节目每周一早上<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="480">8:00</a>更新。📮 如有任何问题或反馈，欢迎评论区留言。</span></p>]]></description>
