  <item>
    <title>安室奈美惠彻底下架歌曲，看了隐退演唱会的我这样说：</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65b520b3513a776b57a997be</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65b520b3513a776b57a997be</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 27 Jan 2024 15:26:43 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>大病初愈后录制的第一期节目，录制得有气无力。但这一切都不重要，重要的是我们伟大的安室奈美惠。本期主要是分享安室奈美惠好听的音乐和她的个人故事，以及我们听众的故事。观看过安室奈美惠隐退演唱会的我，对40岁仍旧能够载歌载舞30首的安妈有无限的尊重，但也不仅于此，克制控制禁欲，这些是安妈教会我的事。</span></p><span></span><p><span>疯狂打碟时间，开着车骑着车只想听歌，不想听我虚弱说话的，请直接点：<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2050">34:10</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>本期具体曲目（按播放顺序）：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="229">03:49</a> Wild</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="680">11:20</a> Can you celebrate？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1115">18:35</a> Try me</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1217">20:17</a> Body feel exit</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2048">34:08</a> New Look</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2343">39:03</a> Photogenic</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2408">40:08</a> Neonlight Lipstick</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2506">41:46</a> In The Spotlight(TOKYO)</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2859">47:39</a> Love Story</span></p>]]></description>
